  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        111.26031494140625,
        429.1253356933594,
        149.50030517578125
      ],
      "text": "3. Recommendations for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bk",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        149.66033935546875,
        421.8708190917969,
        187.90032958984375
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis of TB infection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bk",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        230.55262756347656,
        491.6230773925781,
        252.7826385498047
      ],
      "text": "3.1. Mycobacterium tuberculosis antigen-based",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        253.3526153564453,
        440.1443176269531,
        275.5826110839844
      ],
      "text": "skin tests for the diagnosis of TB infection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        284.673583984375,
        526.9370727539062,
        297.818603515625
      ],
      "text": "Since 2011, the World Health Organization (WHO) has issued recommendations on the use",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.173583984375,
        526.926025390625,
        313.318603515625
      ],
      "text": "of IGRAs for the diagnosis of TB infection. In 2018, WHO updated the recommendations to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        315.673583984375,
        526.9962158203125,
        328.818603515625
      ],
      "text": "stipulate that the TST or IGRAs (or both) can be used to test for TB infection in LMIC. The TST is a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.97241497039795,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.1736145019531,
        526.8917236328125,
        344.3186340332031
      ],
      "text": "widely used point-of-care test that involves intradermal injection of purified protein derivative",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99274730682373,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        346.6736145019531,
        526.9644775390625,
        359.8186340332031
      ],
      "text": "(PPD), a crude mixture of different mycobacterial antigens, which stimulates a delayed-type",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.1736145019531,
        526.969970703125,
        375.3186340332031
      ],
      "text": "hypersensitivity response and causes induration at the injection site within 48–72 hours. This",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        377.6736145019531,
        526.9378051757812,
        390.8186340332031
      ],
      "text": "test has relatively low specificity in those with recent bacille Calmette-Guérin (BCG) vaccination",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.97652530670166,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        393.1736145019531,
        527.102783203125,
        406.3186340332031
      ],
      "text": "and low sensitivity in immunosuppressed individuals (e.g. people living with HIV [PLHIV]); hence,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        408.6736145019531,
        526.9656982421875,
        421.8186340332031
      ],
      "text": "interpretive cut-offs must be adapted for these populations. A follow-up clinic visit is required",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.1736145019531,
        527.0029296875,
        437.3186340332031
      ],
      "text": "after the placement of the TST, and results must be read within the suggested time frame",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.6736145019531,
        526.9918823242188,
        452.8186340332031
      ],
      "text": "to be valid. In contrast, IGRAs are in vitro tests that measure release of interferon- gamma",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.2386169433594,
        526.9683227539062,
        469.0556335449219
      ],
      "text": "γ (IFN- ) by T-cells following stimulation by the early secretory antigenic target 6 kDa protein",
      "font": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        470.6736145019531,
        526.9634399414062,
        483.8186340332031
      ],
      "text": "(ESAT-6) and culture filtrate protein 10 (CFP-10) antigens that are specific to Mtb. Unlike the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.1736145019531,
        527.0457763671875,
        499.3186340332031
      ],
      "text": "TST, IGRAs are not affected by prior BCG vaccination, or by infection with nontuberculous",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.673583984375,
        527.1240234375,
        514.818603515625
      ],
      "text": "mycobacteria (NTM), with few exceptions. However, IGRA platforms are more expensive to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.173583984375,
        526.9258422851562,
        530.318603515625
      ],
      "text": "run and require specialized facilities and trained personnel; consequently, the TST is the most",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.673583984375,
        526.5685424804688,
        545.818603515625
      ],
      "text": "commonly used test for TB infection globally. Recent global shortages of PPD have underscored",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.963740348815918,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.173583984375,
        193.67999267578125,
        561.318603515625
      ],
      "text": "the need for alternatives.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.177490234375,
        526.9371337890625,
        585.322509765625
      ],
      "text": "In addition to the TB skin tests and interferon gamma release assays previously recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        587.677490234375,
        526.9644165039062,
        600.822509765625
      ],
      "text": "by WHO, Mtb antigen-based skin tests (TBSTs) based on specific antigens have recently been",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        603.177490234375,
        524.41796875,
        616.322509765625
      ],
      "text": "developed, using the same ESAT-6 and CFP-10 antigens; these tests combine the simpler skin-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.677490234375,
        526.9634399414062,
        631.822509765625
      ],
      "text": "test platform with the specificity of IGRAs. TBSTs include the Cy-Tb (Serum Institute of India,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        634.177490234375,
        527.01953125,
        647.322509765625
      ],
      "text": "India), Diaskintest® (Generium, Russian Federation) and C-TST (formerly known as ESAT6-CFP10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.960227966308594,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        649.677490234375,
        527.0194702148438,
        662.822509765625
      ],
      "text": "test, Anhui Zhifei Longcom, China). All tests use intradermal injection of antigen and, like the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        665.177490234375,
        526.9369506835938,
        678.322509765625
      ],
      "text": "TST, are read after 48–72 hours as induration in millimetres, using the method suggested by",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        680.677490234375,
        526.9921875,
        693.822509765625
      ],
      "text": "Mantoux. Emerging evidence suggests that, compared with IGRAs, the tests may have similar",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        696.177490234375,
        527.134521484375,
        709.322509765625
      ],
      "text": "specificity and provide more reliable results in children and adolescents as well as in PLHIV than",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974821090698242,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        711.677490234375,
        413.2136535644531,
        724.822509765625
      ],
      "text": "the TST. However, the evidence had not been systematically reviewed.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        735.681396484375,
        526.9149169921875,
        748.826416015625
      ],
      "text": "In 2021, WHO commissioned a systematic review of published and unpublished data on this",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        751.181396484375,
        527.3097534179688,
        764.326416015625
      ],
      "text": "new class of tests for TB infection not previously revieed by WHO. The systematic review included",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        543.0333862304688,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "121",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}